  <div class="shell hero-frame">
    <div class="text-zone hero-intro hero-intro-aside">
      <p class="eyebrow">Studio Overview</p>
      <h1>Static Garden</h1>
      <p class="lead">Static Garden is a complete audio and video studio that assists artists and creators in bringing their ideas to life. Through learning, creating, and building, Static Garden takes projects from rough concepts to full production, release, and distribution.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-lanes hero-lanes-band" aria-label="Core areas">
      <article class="lane-panel">
        <p class="card-kicker">Learn</p>
        <p>Static Garden is a place to learn groove, musicianship, writing, gear, podcasting, video editing, and more. You can learn at your own pace through free online resources or receive personalized help with one-on-one sessions.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="lane-panel">
        <p class="card-kicker">Create</p>
        <p>Creation drives Static Garden. The studio believes everyone has ideas worth developing. Clients have access to industry-standard equipment, guidance, and collaboration. The result is a production experience with structure, support, and space to grow.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="lane-panel">
        <p class="card-kicker">Build</p>
        <p>Promotion, analytics, community engagement, and organization are crucial for launching creative projects. Static Garden provides website development, SaaS integrations, maintenance, and troubleshooting to keep those projects running.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
