      <h2>A small axe for a big tree</h2>
      <p>At its core, Static Garden Studio is a cozy and capable private workshop focused on audio and video post-production. It combines analog and digital environments, centered around a vintage analog Soundcraft console and a modern digital Midas mixer workflow. The studio can handle various projects, from a simple podcast to a full live multi-track band recording. The space is warm and inviting, designed to help ideas grow into polished productions.</p>
