      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h2>Static Garden</h2>
      <p>Static Garden was founded on the belief that ideas should be shared and developed in a space where they can be effectively communicated and showcased to the world. The studio consists of three distinct areas: Power Chord Theory, Twirl Tape Productions, and Plain Text Support. These areas focus on learning, creating, and building. Through coaching, guidance, and collaborative production, Static Garden serves as a hub for creative projects, providing a space for development and growth.</p>
    </div>

