        <p class="card-kicker">Learn</p>
        <h3>Power Chord Theory</h3>
        <p>A groove-based learning and coaching platform for musicians interested in bass and guitar. While many music programs focus on harmony, Power Chord Theory emphasizes feel and touch. It offers a new approach to playing by demonstrating how working musicians learn, practice, and teach one another.</p>
        <a class="project-url" href="https://powerchordtheory.com" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">powerchordtheory.com</a>
        <a href="mailto:studio@powerchordtheory.com">studio@powerchordtheory.com</a>
      </article>

