            <button class="projects-switch" type="button" data-project-button="build" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="project-panel-build">Build</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <p class="card-kicker">Create</p>
        <h3>Twirl Tape Productions</h3>
        <p>A production house specializing in music recording, podcasting, and video post-production. It transforms ideas into polished, release-ready projects. Twirl Tape also offers mentorship and guidance, making it easier for creatives of any skill level to realize their projects.</p>
